  "label": "general internet audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad general internet audience familiar with meme culture, particularly those who appreciate offensive humor, shock value, and the juxtaposition of innocent visuals with vulgar text. The target community includes users who understand and engage with internet memes that rely on irony, absurdity, and crude language for comedic effect, even if the content is potentially offensive or harmful. The use of a well-known actor (Tim Robbins) as a visual anchor further indicates the meme is intended for an audience that recognizes celebrity imagery and can interpret the contrast between the actor's expression and the text as a form of humor.",
